    employing or partner organization. You are responsible for keeping your sign-in
    credentials confidential and for activity that occurs under your account.
  </p>

  <h2>2. Acceptable Use</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Do not upload content that violates the law or another party&rsquo;s rights.</li>
    <li>Do not attempt to access data belonging to organizations you are not a member of.</li>
    <li>Do not reverse-engineer, scrape, or interfere with the Service&rsquo;s operation.</li>
    <li>Do not misrepresent your identity, role, or affiliation inside the app.</li>
